# Active Directory Lab Setup

## Requirements
- Windows Server 2019 (Domain Controller)
- Windows 10 Client
- Kali Linux (Attacker)

## Network
- Domain: ignite.local
- DC: 192.168.1.48
- Kali: 192.168.1.100

## Tools Installation (Kali)

sudo apt update
sudo apt install netexec bloodhound neo4j

## Start BloodHound

sudo neo4j console
bloodhound
